<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BIG SELLERS OF S.AFRICA BONDS LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BIG SELLERS OF S.AFRICA BONDS LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were substantial</p>
<p>net sellers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond</p>
<p>Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				     Week to July 18   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		  9,436.04	    217,006.28</p>
<p>    - sales		     11,298.43	    203,501.57</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales) (1,862.39)	    13,504.71</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
